    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Embraced against his will in 1770 by Sir Edward Scott (who fed on him while fleeing pursuers and does not recall the encounter), Akawa is a Plains Indian warrior turned Anarch elder who now leads the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.antitribu.JournalEntry.hs33xrNXWT2UXXS4]{Blood Brothers}, one of Milwaukee's two dominant Anarch gangs. He has learned Scott's true identity as his sire but has said nothing &mdash; a secret he holds in reserve, believing \"this will be his undoing.\" A calm, deliberate tactician among the more impulsive Anarchs, Akawa can shapeshift into a wolf form and prefers this guise when leading the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.antitribu.JournalEntry.hs33xrNXWT2UXXS4]{Blood Brothers}. He commands total loyalty from his gang, including his volatile childe Wrecker, and wages a running turf war against Turk's rival gang, the Union.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Serious and grim, speaking in old-fashioned turns of phrase (\"sunrises\" instead of \"days,\" \"the final sleep\" instead of death). Calm, observant, and in control &mdash; his patience and plotting are worthy of an Elder twice his age.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Sir Edward Scott (unaware of the connection). Childe: Wrecker. Haven: none fixed; moves with the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.antitribu.JournalEntry.hs33xrNXWT2UXXS4]{Blood Brothers}. Disciplines as printed: Animalism 2, Celerity 4, Fortitude 3, Potence 3, Presence 2, Protean 4 (capped above to this system's 1-5 scale).",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
